13
00:00:38.011 --> 00:00:41.791
We can clearly see the integration of my peritoneal cavity.

14
00:00:42.591 --> 00:00:44.611
Do not forget the synchronicity of development.

15
00:00:45.071 --> 00:00:47.551
One last image to see this integration.

16
00:00:49.251 --> 00:00:51.731
The main driver is growth,

17
00:00:52.111 --> 00:00:55.311
it is the formation of our body,

18
00:00:55.311 --> 00:00:55.971
but it is elsewhere.

19
00:00:56.142 --> 00:01:01.442
primitively, the overall growth of my embryo, the wrapping and the return

