00:01:11.202 --> 00:01:16.422
a three-dimensional movement, even into a fifth dimension.

24
00:01:16.782 --> 00:01:17.242
I mean

25
00:01:17.242 --> 00:01:22.622
by the fourth dimension, time. The fifth dimension, I mean, is this energetic,

26
00:01:22.622 --> 00:01:24.142
electric component.

27
00:01:24.213 --> 00:01:26.833
that underlies the entire system.

28
00:01:27.533 --> 00:01:32.653
Do not forget that this movement is always integrated within this upward phase

29
00:01:32.653 --> 00:01:33.593
of my ectoderm

30
00:01:33.593 --> 00:01:38.813
and the relative downward movement of my endoderm, with this phase

31
00:01:38.813 --> 00:01:39.833
almost at heart level.

32
00:01:40.513 --> 00:01:45.573
The ascent of the ectoderm and the descent of the endoderm and the integration of the

33
00:01:45.573 --> 00:01:45.973
heart

34
00:01:46.833 --> 00:01:51.833
stretch the pouches of the diaphragmatic musculature and those of the future

35
00:01:51.833 --> 00:01:52.153
